PRINTFORML A Lunarian goddess (Divine Spirit).
PRINTFORML Largely mysterious, thought to be part heavenly god, part earthly god, and connected to Amanojaku by her roots, yet separate.
PRINTFORML Because of her ability, every word she utters carries power to reverse fate, so she must choose her words carefully.
PRINTFORML When the Lunar Capital was attacked, she planned to move the capital to Gensokyo and take command of the Earth invasion,
PRINTFORML but she herself was not very enthusiastic about it.
PRINTFORML After helping Reimu Hakurei and others resolve the incident, she seems to have plenty of leeway to visit Gensokyo
PRINTFORML periodically and negotiate with Earthlings if necessary.
RETURN 1